# playerversus_purgatory_fights: part of the soundtrack of PLAYER VERSUS's PURGATORY mode (its fights and its bosses). It comes
# in as a dependency of danny.playerversus_purgatory (the mode's code), which the game offers to
# install the first time you choose PURGATORY. The tracks are the .ogg files in music/ (credits in music/SOURCES.md).
#
# Flywheel doesn't tell a module where its files are, so PLAYER VERSUS finds this package's folder
# itself (music.fw looks where Pulley puts library installs) and plays music/<name>.ogg from it.

# The folder inside this package that holds the tracks.
const string MUSIC_FOLDER = "music"
